{"id":"u08","kelas":7,"no":8,"judul":"Makanan dan Minuman","title":"Food and Drinks","emoji":"🍜","ringkas":"Countable/uncountable, some/any, dan memesan makanan","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut nama makanan, minuman, dan waktu makan","membedakan benda yang bisa dihitung (countable) dan tidak bisa dihitung (uncountable)","memakai [[a / an]], [[some]], dan [[any]] dengan benar","bertanya jumlah dengan [[How many ...?]] dan [[How much ...?]]","memesan makanan dengan sopan: [[I'd like ...]], [[Can I have ...?]]","menanyakan dan menyebut harga"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Lapar? Di **Unit 8** kamu belajar semua hal tentang **makanan dan minuman**: menyebut namanya, menghitung jumlahnya, dan **memesan** di kantin atau restoran dengan sopan."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Makanan (Food)","items":[{"en":"rice","id":"nasi","ex":"I eat rice every day."},{"en":"noodles","id":"mi","ex":"She likes fried noodles."},{"en":"bread","id":"roti","ex":"I have bread for breakfast."},{"en":"egg","id":"telur","ex":"I want a boiled egg."},{"en":"chicken","id":"ayam","ex":"Fried chicken is delicious."},{"en":"fish","id":"ikan","ex":"We have fish for lunch."},{"en":"meat","id":"daging","ex":"He doesn't eat meat."},{"en":"vegetables","id":"sayuran","ex":"Eat more vegetables."},{"en":"fruit","id":"buah","ex":"I like fruit."},{"en":"apple","id":"apel","ex":"An apple a day."},{"en":"banana","id":"pisang","ex":"Monkeys love bananas."},{"en":"cake","id":"kue","ex":"This cake is sweet."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Minuman (Drinks)","items":[{"en":"water","id":"air","ex":"Drink more water."},{"en":"tea","id":"teh","ex":"A cup of tea, please."},{"en":"coffee","id":"kopi","ex":"My father drinks coffee."},{"en":"milk","id":"susu","ex":"I drink milk every morning."},{"en":"orange juice","id":"jus jeruk","ex":"A glass of orange juice, please."},{"en":"ice","id":"es","ex":"Tea with ice."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Waktu makan dan rasa","items":[{"en":"breakfast","id":"sarapan","ex":"I have breakfast at six."},{"en":"lunch","id":"makan siang","ex":"We have lunch at noon."},{"en":"dinner","id":"makan malam","ex":"Dinner is ready."},{"en":"snack","id":"camilan","ex":"I eat a snack at school."},{"en":"delicious","id":"lezat","ex":"The soup is delicious."},{"en":"sweet","id":"manis","ex":"Tea with sugar is sweet."},{"en":"salty","id":"asin","ex":"This fish is salty."},{"en":"spicy","id":"pedas","ex":"I like spicy food."},{"en":"sour","id":"asam","ex":"Lemon is sour."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Countable dan uncountable","text":"Benda dalam bahasa Inggris ada dua jenis:\n• **Countable** (bisa dihitung satu per satu): *an egg, two eggs, three apples*.\n• **Uncountable** (tidak bisa dihitung satu per satu): *rice, water, milk, sugar, bread, meat*.","table":[["Jenis","Contoh","Bisa pakai a/an?","Bisa dijamakkan (-s)?"],["Countable","egg, apple, banana, sandwich","Ya: [[an egg]]","Ya: [[three eggs]]"],["Uncountable","rice, water, milk, bread","Tidak: ~~a rice~~","Tidak: ~~two rices~~"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Menghitung benda uncountable","text":"Pakai **wadah atau ukuran**: [[a glass of water]], [[a cup of tea]], [[a plate of rice]], [[a bowl of soup]], [[a piece of cake]], [[a bottle of milk]], [[a slice of bread]]. Wadahnya bisa dihitung: *two glasses of water*."},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. A/an, some, dan any","table":[["Kata","Dipakai dengan","Dalam kalimat","Contoh"],["**a / an**","countable **satu**","positif","[[I have an apple.]]"],["**some**","countable banyak **dan** uncountable","positif","[[I have some apples.]] / [[There is some milk.]]"],["**any**","countable banyak dan uncountable","negatif dan pertanyaan","[[I don't have any apples.]] / [[Is there any milk?]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Pengecualian: tawaran dan permintaan","text":"Dalam **tawaran** atau **permintaan** yang kita harapkan dijawab \"ya\", pakai **some**: [[Would you like some tea?]] dan [[Can I have some water?]]"},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. How many dan How much","table":[["Pertanyaan","Dipakai untuk","Contoh"],["**How many** + benda jamak?","countable","[[How many eggs do you want?]] — Two."],["**How much** + benda?","uncountable","[[How much milk do you drink?]] — A glass."],["**How much is/are ...?**","harga","[[How much is the fried rice?]] — It's fifteen thousand rupiah."]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"7. Memesan makanan dengan sopan","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan"],["Pelayan bertanya","[[What would you like?]] / [[Can I help you?]]"],["Memesan","[[I'd like a bowl of meatball soup, please.]] / [[Can I have a glass of orange juice?]]"],["Menawarkan","[[Would you like some tea?]]"],["Menerima","[[Yes, please.]]"],["Menolak","[[No, thank you.]]"],["Menyerahkan","[[Here you are.]]"],["Menanyakan harga","[[How much is it?]] / [[How much is that?]]"],["Membayar","[[Here is the money.]] / [[Keep the change.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"I'd like = I would like","text":"**I'd like** artinya \"Saya mau\" dan terdengar lebih sopan daripada *I want*. Di restoran atau kantin, pakai **I'd like** atau **Can I have ...?**"},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Di kantin sekolah","lines":[{"who":"Seller","en":"Hello! What would you like?","id":"Halo! Mau pesan apa?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"I'd like a plate of fried rice and a glass of orange juice, please.","id":"Aku mau sepiring nasi goreng dan segelas jus jeruk."},{"who":"Seller","en":"Would you like some ice in your juice?","id":"Mau pakai es di jusnya?"},{"who":"Rani","en":"Yes, please. How much is it?","id":"Ya. Berapa harganya?"},{"who":"Seller","en":"It's twenty thousand rupiah.","id":"Dua puluh ribu rupiah."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Here you are. Thank you!","id":"Ini uangnya. Terima kasih!"}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Countable: [[an egg]], [[two eggs]]. Uncountable: [[rice]], [[water]], [[milk]] (tidak pakai a/an dan tidak diberi -s).","Wadah: [[a glass of]], [[a cup of]], [[a plate of]], [[a bowl of]], [[a piece of]].","[[some]] untuk kalimat positif dan tawaran. [[any]] untuk negatif dan pertanyaan.","[[How many]] + countable jamak, [[How much]] + uncountable atau harga.","Memesan sopan: [[I'd like ..., please.]] / [[Can I have ...?]]"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan makanan dan minuman dengan artinya:","pairs":[["rice","nasi"],["chicken","ayam"],["water","air"],["milk","susu"],["vegetables","sayuran"]],"exp":"Kosakata makanan dipakai setiap hari.","k":"f5ea892a"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan rasa dengan artinya:","pairs":[["sweet","manis"],["spicy","pedas"],["salty","asin"],["sour","asam"],["delicious","lezat"]],"exp":"Rasa menjelaskan makanan.","k":"248a9831"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang uncountable?","options":["egg","apple","milk","banana"],"answer":2,"exp":"Milk (susu) tidak dihitung satu per satu.","k":"145d0acf"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang countable?","options":["rice","water","banana","sugar"],"answer":2,"exp":"Banana bisa dihitung: a banana, two bananas.","k":"1d3ec6ab"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku mau sebutir telur.","q":"I'd like ___ egg. (a / an)","answers":["an"],"hint":"a / an ?","exp":"Egg dimulai bunyi huruf hidup, jadi an.","k":"7e563512"},{"type":"fill","id":"Segelas air.","q":"a ___ of water","answers":["glass"],"hint":"g _ _ _ _","exp":"a glass of water.","k":"df60aab3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sepiring nasi.","q":"a ___ of rice","answers":["plate"],"hint":"p _ _ _ _","exp":"a plate of rice.","k":"e121624c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I have a rice.","I have some rice.","I have two rices.","I have an rice."],"answer":1,"exp":"Rice uncountable, jadi some rice.","k":"d947dff6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tidak ada susu di kulkas.","q":"There isn't ___ milk in the fridge.","answers":["any"],"hint":"some / any ?","exp":"Negatif → any.","k":"61895ed0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah ada telur di kulkas?","q":"Are there ___ eggs in the fridge?","answers":["any"],"hint":"some / any ?","exp":"Pertanyaan → any.","k":"fd7378d0"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tawaran sopan yang benar adalah...","options":["Would you like any tea?","Would you like some tea?","Do you want a tea some?","You like tea?"],"answer":1,"exp":"Dalam tawaran, pakai some.","k":"5f6a5d67"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berapa butir telur yang kamu mau?","q":"How ___ eggs do you want?","answers":["many"],"hint":"many / much ?","exp":"Eggs countable jamak → How many.","k":"6d55c4a7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berapa banyak susu yang kamu minum?","q":"How ___ milk do you drink?","answers":["much"],"hint":"many / much ?","exp":"Milk uncountable → How much.","k":"faf21ed4"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku mau semangkuk bakso.\"","answer":"I'd like a bowl of meatball soup.","exp":"I'd like + a bowl of + makanan.","k":"1e5edae5"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Berapa harganya?\"","answer":"How much is it?","exp":"How much is it? untuk menanyakan harga.","k":"946a0c32"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dipesan?","say":"I'd like a glass of orange juice please","options":["Segelas jus jeruk","Sepiring nasi","Sebotol air","Secangkir teh"],"answer":0,"exp":"glass of orange juice = segelas jus jeruk.","k":"1a2b77ea"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan makanan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["noodles","mi"],["bread","roti"],["egg","telur"],["fish","ikan"],["meat","daging"]],"exp":"Makanan.","k":"b831307d"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan minuman dengan artinya:","pairs":[["tea","teh"],["coffee","kopi"],["orange juice","jus jeruk"],["ice","es"],["milk","susu"]],"exp":"Minuman.","k":"1154f51a"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan wadah dengan benda:","pairs":[["a cup of","coffee"],["a bottle of","water"],["a piece of","cake"],["a bowl of","soup"],["a plate of","fried rice"]],"exp":"Satuan wadah.","k":"3bff227b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang countable?","options":["sandwich","rice","water","sugar"],"answer":0,"exp":"sandwich bisa dihitung.","k":"6f7a6ce8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang uncountable?","options":["bread","egg","apple","banana"],"answer":0,"exp":"bread (roti) uncountable; a slice of bread.","k":"d275726d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I'd like an apple.","I'd like a apple.","I'd like apples a.","I'd like an apples."],"answer":0,"exp":"apple dimulai vokal → an.","k":"bd96db57"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["There is some milk in the glass.","There is a milk in the glass.","There are some milk in the glass.","There is many milk in the glass."],"answer":0,"exp":"milk uncountable → some milk, is.","k":"c1533bac"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I don't have any money.","I don't have some money.","I don't have a money.","I don't have many money."],"answer":0,"exp":"Negatif → any.","k":"19b7cef8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["How many bananas do you want?","How much bananas do you want?","How many banana do you want?","How much banana do you want?"],"answer":0,"exp":"bananas countable jamak → How many.","k":"f607cc88"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["How much sugar do you need?","How many sugar do you need?","How much sugars do you need?","How many sugars do you need?"],"answer":0,"exp":"sugar uncountable → How much.","k":"7aeff2e9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara meminta minuman dengan sopan adalah...","options":["Can I have a glass of water, please?","Give me water.","I want water now.","Water me."],"answer":0,"exp":"Can I have ..., please?","k":"dd11bf6d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Saat menawarkan teh, kita bilang...","options":["Would you like some tea?","Do you want any tea?","You want tea?","Tea you like?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tawaran memakai some.","k":"7c2847f7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Segelas susu.","q":"a ___ of milk","answers":["glass"],"hint":"g _ _ _ _","exp":"a glass of milk.","k":"8c068b63"},{"type":"fill","id":"Semangkuk bakso.","q":"a ___ of meatball soup","answers":["bowl"],"hint":"b _ _ _","exp":"a bowl of soup.","k":"6752f5c6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Seiris roti.","q":"a ___ of bread","answers":["slice"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _","exp":"a slice of bread.","k":"08c37f1f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ada beberapa apel di meja.","q":"There are ___ apples on the table.","answers":["some"],"hint":"some / any ?","exp":"Positif → some.","k":"ccb3ac8f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku mau segelas jus jeruk.\"","answer":"I'd like a glass of orange juice.","exp":"I'd like + a glass of + minuman.","k":"f9876ae3"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Berapa harga ini?\"","answer":"How much is this?","exp":"How much is this?","k":"79354979"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku tidak mau teh, terima kasih.\"","answer":"I don't want tea, thank you.","exp":"I don't want + ...","k":"dd2c4da5"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dipesan?","say":"I'd like a bowl of soup please","options":["Semangkuk sup","Sepiring nasi","Segelas teh","Sepotong kue"],"answer":0,"exp":"bowl of soup = semangkuk sup.","k":"145d9cf0"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Berapa harganya?","say":"It's ten thousand rupiah","options":["Sepuluh ribu rupiah","Seratus ribu rupiah","Satu ribu rupiah","Sepuluh rupiah"],"answer":0,"exp":"ten thousand = 10.000.","k":"ec35996e"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa rasanya?","say":"This soup is spicy","options":["Pedas","Manis","Asin","Asam"],"answer":0,"exp":"spicy = pedas.","k":"7e2a33d5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"For breakfast, I eat bread and eggs. I drink a glass of milk. My brother drinks tea.\" Apa yang diminum kakak?","options":["Teh","Susu","Kopi","Jus"],"answer":0,"exp":"My brother drinks tea.","k":"1a5e9327"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"At the canteen, Rani buys a plate of fried rice and a glass of orange juice. It costs twenty thousand rupiah.\" Apa yang diminum Rani?","options":["Jus jeruk","Teh manis","Susu","Air putih"],"answer":0,"exp":"orange juice.","k":"408d97ac"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"There is some milk in the fridge. There aren't any eggs.\" Apa yang tidak ada di kulkas?","options":["Telur","Susu","Roti","Air"],"answer":0,"exp":"aren't any eggs.","k":"c8b0bcf7"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What would you like?\" B: \"___\"","options":["I'd like a bowl of soup, please.","I'm twelve.","It's Monday.","She is my sister."],"answer":0,"exp":"memesan.","k":"1f6ea25b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"How much is the cake?\" B: \"___\"","options":["It's ten thousand rupiah.","It's delicious.","There are three.","I like it."],"answer":0,"exp":"harga.","k":"4eb76eb6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["I'd like a rice.","I'd like some rice.","I'd like a plate of rice.","I'd like rice."],"answer":0,"exp":"rice uncountable.","k":"a61b5a66"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["How many water do you drink?","How much water do you drink?","How many eggs do you want?","How much milk do you drink?"],"answer":0,"exp":"water → How much.","k":"a5049244"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["There isn't some milk.","There isn't any milk.","There is some milk.","Is there any milk?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Negatif → any.","k":"269769e3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Boleh aku minta segelas air?\" adalah...","options":["Can I have a glass of water?","Can I have a glass water?","I can have glass of water?","Can have I a glass of water?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Can I have ...?","k":"632f1cde"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Makanan ini sangat pedas\" adalah...","options":["This food is very spicy.","This food are very spicy.","This food has very spicy.","This food spicy very."],"answer":0,"exp":"is spicy.","k":"1617273e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["spoon","rice","bread","egg"],"answer":0,"exp":"spoon = alat makan.","k":"e9a0751b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Apakah kamu mau teh? (menawarkan)","q":"Would you like ___ tea?","answers":["some"],"hint":"some / any ?","exp":"Tawaran → some.","k":"6322bb16"},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku tidak punya telur.","q":"I don't have ___ eggs.","answers":["any"],"hint":"some / any ?","exp":"Negatif → any.","k":"ad67d323"},{"type":"fill","id":"Berapa harga baju ini?","q":"How ___ is this shirt?","answers":["much"],"hint":"m _ _ _","exp":"How much is ...?","k":"18f133b3"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebotol air.","q":"a ___ of water","answers":["bottle"],"hint":"b _ _ _ _ _","exp":"a bottle of water.","k":"cb3c3727"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku ingin sepotong kue, tolong.\"","answer":"I'd like a piece of cake, please.","exp":"I'd like + a piece of + makanan.","k":"a9abfb79"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Berapa butir telur yang kamu mau?\"","answer":"How many eggs do you want?","exp":"How many + countable?","k":"9ad1a616"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dipesan?","say":"A glass of milk and a piece of bread please","options":["Segelas susu dan sepotong roti","Secangkir teh dan kue","Sepiring nasi dan ikan","Semangkuk sup"],"answer":0,"exp":"milk; bread.","k":"baac7b69"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Berapa harganya?","say":"It's fifteen thousand rupiah","options":["Lima belas ribu","Lima puluh ribu","Lima ribu","Lima ratus ribu"],"answer":0,"exp":"fifteen thousand = 15.000.","k":"f212db34"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Kamu di kantin dan ingin memesan teh. Apa yang kamu katakan?","options":["Can I have a glass of tea, please?","I want tea now.","Give tea me.","Tea please you."],"answer":0,"exp":"Can I have.","k":"a3bc06ad"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Penjual bertanya, \"Anything else?\" Kamu sudah cukup. Jawabanmu?","options":["No, thank you. That's all.","Yes, I'm twelve.","Goodbye, Sir.","It's Monday."],"answer":0,"exp":"That's all.","k":"d7318759"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["vegetables","vegtables","vegetabels","vegitables"],"answer":0,"exp":"vegetables.","k":"57289a56"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["delicious","delicius","delisious","deliscious"],"answer":0,"exp":"delicious.","k":"2916b171"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["breakfast","brakefast","breakfest","brekfast"],"answer":0,"exp":"breakfast.","k":